  "label": "Rare Genetic Condition",
  "description": "A medical condition caused by genetic mutations that affects a small number of people. Lizzie Velasquez has a rare genetic condition called Progeria (Hutchinson-Gilford Progeria Syndrome), which causes rapid aging and extreme physical differences. This knowledge is necessary to understand the context of the text stating she was 'born with a rare disease'.",
